                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">Hereford Cathedral O.ii.4, All Souls Coll. 82
                        and Jesus Coll. 26 are inscribed "Liber Magistri Aluredi", s. xii/xiii
                        (?).</note>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes"> </note>
